1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:02,317
No, thank you!
We're good!

2
00:00:03,451 --> 00:00:05,381
(string instruments playing
"Bridal Chorus")

3
00:00:05,453 --> 00:00:06,983
(Sheldon:)Raj, you're probably wondering

4
00:00:07,054 --> 00:00:10,554
(Sheldon:)why Amy and I aren't showing
any affection to one another.

5
00:00:10,624 --> 00:00:12,794
(Raj:)Didn't even crack the top ten.

6
00:00:14,861 --> 00:00:15,891
(Sheldon:)Well, you should know

7
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:17,533
(Sheldon:)that she recently
broke up with me.

8
00:00:17,598 --> 00:00:20,398
(Amy:)I said I needed
time to think.

9
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:22,737
(Raj:)I'm sure you guys
will figure something out.

10
00:00:22,803 --> 00:00:25,503
(Sheldon:)You hear that?
Raj is devastated.

11
00:00:25,572 --> 00:00:28,272
(Bernadette:)Sheldon, shh.
The wedding's starting.

12
00:00:28,341 --> 00:00:29,911
(Sheldon:)I see what's happening.

13
00:00:29,977 --> 00:00:31,247
(Sheldon:)Sides are forming.

14
00:00:31,311 --> 00:00:33,411
(Sheldon:)Well, if Bernadette's
on Amy's team, I pick Howard.

15
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,510
(Howard:)I'm not taking sides.

16
00:00:34,581 --> 00:00:35,981
(Sheldon:)Fine, I guess
I'm stuck with Raj.

17
00:00:36,049 --> 00:00:37,319
(Raj:)Really?

18
00:00:37,383 --> 00:00:40,123
(Stuart:)At least you
got picked.

19
00:00:41,855 --> 00:00:42,925
(Official:)Before I go any further,

20
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:44,890
(Official:)have either of you
prepared your own vows?

21
00:00:44,957 --> 00:00:46,387
(Sheldon:)Yes.
No.

22
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:49,123
(Penny:)You wrote vows?

23
00:00:49,194 --> 00:00:50,194
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

24
00:00:50,229 --> 00:00:51,929
(Penny:)Well, I don't have any.

25
00:00:51,998 --> 00:00:54,668
(Penny:)You're kind of
making me look bad.

26
00:00:54,734 --> 00:00:57,204
It's okay. I-I don't
have to say them.

27
00:00:57,269 --> 00:00:58,569
(Penny:)No, no, no, go ahead.

